1 NOTE He was the Parish Priest in Vår Frue Kirke (Church of Our Lady) in Trondheim, Norway from 1633 to his death.  In tax records of 1645 Jensen is listed as the owner of the farm Romfo in Sundal, a farm which was part of the Aspa inhe
2 CONC ritance, indicating that he or his wife was probably a descendent of the Trygge family.
