1 NOTE Mille OUDENSDATTER giftet seg med Mikkel Christensøn. Hun var av den yngre Aspætt eller slekten Trygge på Aspen.
1 NOTE She was a member of the Aspa family, named in 1645 as the owner of property in Hordaland and on the Møre Coast. After her first husband's death, she remarried in 1619 Herr Melchior Jakobssøn (Falck), the son of Jakob Pedersen.  He
2 CONC rr Melchior was the Parish Priest in Hitra and Hemne and died in 1639. They had one child, Milde Melchiorsdatter (Falck), born ca. 1620, married to Anders Nielsen Riber with five children, Melchior, Milde, Niels, Margrete and one 
2 CONC unknown daughter.
