1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Etne-soga by Ståle Dyrvik, vol IV  "Folket. Stødle sokn" Hovland (9) p 265
2 CONT Claude.ai translation
2 CONT Bruk 2
2 CONT Separated in 1859 from farm 1–2
2 CONT 9. Tolleiv Ingebriktsson b.1842 at Hovland (4i), d.1938 at Hovland. Married in Skånevik 1869 to Ingeborg Tørrisdotter b.1846 at Sandvik (58g) in Skånevik, d.1896 at Hovland. Tolleiv must have run this farm from around 1860, but it
2 CONC  was first in connection with the marriage in 1869 that he received the deed to it. The price was 600 spd. and a condition that was considerably less than what Ingebrikt had had to pay fifty years earlier. Ingebrikt reserved, amon
2 CONC g other things, room for his potatoes in the potato cellar, and was to have half the glass-room entirely to himself and a say in the use of the other half. Like his father, Tolleiv fetched a wife from Skånevik. Ingeborg got cancer
2 CONC  and died in 1896. The two youngest children then stayed home and helped their father with the farm work.
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT a. Anna Madela b.1870, d.1937 at Skjold (11)
2 CONT b. Ingeborg b.1871, emigrated 1895 to America
2 CONT c. Ragna b.1873, emigrated ca.1889
2 CONT d. Ingebrikt b.1875, emigrated 1917 to America. See below.
2 CONT e. Valgjde Marie b. 1882 emigrated 1919 to America
