1 NOTE {geni:about_me} from find a grave:
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Ingebret Hovland and Anna Valdre.
2 CONT
2 CONT From Nevada Evening Journal June 24, 1938
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. T. T. Sande Died Today at Home In Story City
2 CONT
2 CONT Special to the Journal:  Story City, June 24--Mrs. T. T. Sande, 88, one of the oldest women of Story City, died at her home here early today after an illness of a week from complications incident to her advanced years. The family 
2 CONC had lived in Story City after moving here from a nearby farm about 22 years ago.
2 CONT
2 CONT Services will be held Monday, with prayer at the home at 1:45 and the funeral at Bethel Lutheran church at 2:00. Burial will be in the Roland cemetery. The service will be in charge of her pastor, Rev. G. O. Paulsrud.
2 CONT
2 CONT She leaves besides her husband and her daughter Julia in the home, the sons, I. T. Alfred and Elmer of Story City and a brother in Norway.
