2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/119428945/martha-t-tweedt
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha T Severson Tweedt BIRTH	8 Jul 1828 Norway DEATH	13 Jul 1898 (aged 70) Emmet County, Iowa, USA BURIAL	 Norwegian Cemetery Estherville, Emmet County, Iowa, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT (Maiden name also spelled "Sivertsdatter," and married last name also spelled "Tveit". )
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Martha Tweedt died at the home of her daughter, Mrs. Andrew Dobby [Dobbe], in Ellsworth township, Monday, July 11th. She was seventy-one years of age and had been in feeble health for some time. She was the mother of T.K. Twe
2 CONC edt of the same township. Funeral services were held at the Dobby residence on Wednesday, July 13th, conducted by Rev. K. Engh, of the Lutheran church. [remainder too dark to read.] (Estherville Democrat, Estherville, IA, July 20,
2 CONC  1898)
