2 CONT Obit: https://www.newspapers.com/clip/90603211/obituary-for-james-allicks-aged-89/
2 CONT
2 CONT '''James Allicks Rites Conducted At Princeton''' 
2 CONT Funeral services were conducted Wednesday for James Allicks, 89, former resident of the Fredonia community, whose death occurred Sunday at Princeton, Ill. The services were held at the Larson Funeral Home at Princeton with burial 
2 CONC at the Millington cemetery. Mr. Allicks was born July 1O, 1864, in Bergen, Norway. He came to this country at the age of 18 years. His wife was the former Nettie Luther and she preceded him in death in 1917. Survivors include two 
2 CONC sons, Earl of West Liberty and Glen of Princeton, nine grandchildren and six great-grandchildren.
