1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''baronesse Eleonora Sophie Rantzau''' was born on August 24, 1779 in Fjællebo, Danmark. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-31826776 Frederik Siegfred Rantzau, til Krengerup (også benævnt Frederikslund)] and [https://
2 CONC www.geni.com/profile-31826775 Sophie Magdalene Krag-Juel-Vind]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleonora Sophie married [https://www.geni.com/profile-67891602 Preben greve Bille Brahe] on July 1, 1796 in Frederikslund, Krenkerup. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * 1798 [https://www.geni.com/profile-67892054 Henrik Bille-Brahe , greve];
2 CONT * 1799 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34710861615 Baron Frederik Siegfred Bille-Brahe]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on March 7, 1800 in København, Danmark. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Elenore Sophie Grevinde Af Bille Brahe (1779-1800) Born "Baroness Rantzau" She is mentioned on page 148 of Danmark's Adel Aarbog https://archive.org/details/danmarksadelaarb1900kj/page/148
