2 PLAC Vestre Gravlund Cemetery, Oslo, Norway
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 29 JUN 1868
2 PLAC Levanger Landsogn, Inn-Trøndelag, Norway
2 ADDR
1 BAPM
