1 NOTE Oscar Egede-Nissen was married a total of five times. In his third marriage, which took place in Oslo on 19 November 1934, he wed actress Unni Torkildsen, born in Oslo 14 August 1901, a daughter of Ja>
2 CONT cob Torkildsen and Minchen Dietz. They had one son, a) Bjørn "Bamse" Egede-Nissen, born in Oslo 8 January 1938, dead of ALS in Oslo in 2003. He was married to Astrid, with whom he had two children, Kr>
2 CONT istin Egede-Nissen and Anniken Egede-Nissen. Bamse was a master mechanic with the Norwegian airline, Braaten, A.S. Astrid was a stewardess with Scandinavian Airlines. Oscar died on 9 (1?) November, 19>
2 CONT 76 in Oslo of cancer.
